原始重力波的发现  我就越兴奋
primordial gravity wave discovery, the more excited I get.

3
00:00:08,590 --> 00:00:10,600
是啊  现在当个天体物理学家
I know. Being an astrophysicist right now

4
00:00:10,600 --> 00:00:12,020
就跟当个摇滚巨星似的
is like being a rock star.

5
00:00:12,020 --> 00:00:13,820
除了没歌迷送炮之外
Only without the sex.

6
00:00:15,330 --> 00:00:17,400
是啊  真是一炮难求
Yeah, literally, none of it.

7
00:00:18,720 --> 00:00:20,420
谢尔顿  你觉得呢
What do you think about it, Sheldon?

8
00:00:20,420 --> 00:00:21,820
切
Meh.

9
00:00:22,790 --> 00:00:24,420
你不是吧  这可能是
Are you kidding me? This may be

10
