我们有生之年所能碰见最大的科研突破
the biggest scientific breakthrough of our lifetime.

11
00:00:27,280 --> 00:00:29,330
而你做为个理论物理学家
How can you, as a theoretical physicist,

12
00:00:29,330 --> 00:00:30,830
居然一点都不关心
not care about this?

13
00:00:30,830 --> 00:00:33,020
可能我不是个精英主义者
Maybe it's because I'm not an elitist.

14
00:00:33,020 --> 00:00:34,390
我更想知道的是
What I'd like to know is:

15
00:00:34,390 --> 00:00:36,320
这个重力波的突破
How does this gravity wave breakthrough

16
00:00:36,320 --> 00:00:38,170
能对一般人有何帮助
help the man on the street? You know?

17
