又有谁关心呢
and all his quantum physics concerns?

19
00:00:43,380 --> 00:00:45,620
天啊  你在嫉妒人家
Oh, my God, you're jealous.

20
00:00:45,620 --> 00:00:48,290
-我为何要嫉妒  -不知道啊
- Why would I be jealous? - Oh, I don't know.

21
00:00:48,290 --> 00:00:51,170
可能宇宙的起源被别人证明了
Maybe because the origin of the universe just got proven,

22
00:00:51,170 --> 00:00:52,700
希格斯力场也被别人证明了
the Higgs field just got proven

23
00:00:52,710 --> 00:00:54,250
而你这20年来对弦理论的研究
and you've been working on string theory

24
00:00:54,250 --> 00:00:56,620
与你刚开始的那会相比
for the last 20 years and you're no closer to proving it

25
00:00:56,620 --> 00:00:58,330
一点进展都没有
than when you started.

26
00:00:59,210 --> 00:01:01,420
是啊  我有太多事情要忙
Yeah, well, I've had a lot on my plate.

27
00:01:02,290 --> 00:01:04,990
我们刚好活在电视界的黄金时期
We happen to live in a golden age of television.

28
00:01:06,240 --> 00:01:07,830
各位  打扰一下
Excuse me, fellas.

29
00:01:08,350 --> 00:01:10,080
抱歉我偷听了你们的谈话
Sorry for eavesdropping,

30
00:01:10,080 --> 00:01:12,380
但其实今天在强子对撞机那里
but there actually was some big string theory news today

31
00:01:12,380 --> 00:01:14,880
-有一条弦理论的大新闻呢  -真的吗
- out of the Hadron Collider. - Really?

32
00:01:14,880 --> 00:01:16,980
他们发现支持额外维度的证明
Did they find evidence to support extra dimensions

33
00:01:16,980 --> 00:01:18,520
-还是超对称性吗  -都不是
- or supersymmetry? - No,

34
00:01:18,520 --> 00:01:21,910
但他们发现了  你什么话都信的证明
but they did find evidence that you'll believe anything.

35
00:01:23,980 --> 00:01:25,650
你为何要这样
Why would you do that?

36
00:01:25,650 --> 00:01:27,570
你也是个弦理论学家啊
You're a string theorist as well.

37
00:01:27,570 --> 00:01:30,790
错了  我是弦理论实用家
Incorrect. I am a string pragmatist.

38
00:01:30,790 --> 00:01:33,080
我跟人说我要证明一个不能被证明的理论
I say I'm gonna prove something that cannot be proved,

39
00:01:33,080 --> 00:01:34,250
然后申请研究款项
I apply for grant money,

40
