这么早就醒啦
Hey, you're up early.

46
00:02:23,990 --> 00:02:25,020
我睡不着
I couldn't sleep.

47
00:02:25,020 --> 00:02:28,680
我早说了别用《行尸走肉》的枕头套
I told you those Walking Dead pillowcases were a bad idea.

48
00:02:29,950 --> 00:02:31,760
跟那个无关
No, that's not it.

49
00:02:31,760 --> 00:02:33,440
有烦心事吗
Is something bothering you?

50
00:02:33,440 --> 00:02:36,240
是啊  不过你不会懂的
Yes, but you wouldn't understand.

51
00:02:36,240 --> 00:02:38,590
别这样  说来听听
Oh, come on, try me.

52
00:02:39,440 --> 00:02:40,310
好吧
All right.

53
00:02:43,490 --> 00:02:46,440
我把我的人生黄金时期都奉献给了弦理论
I've devoted the prime of my life to string theory

54
00:02:46,440 --> 00:02:49,960
致力于探索紧化额外维度
and its quest for the compactification of extra dimensions.

55
00:02:49,990 --> 00:02:53,310
而我连一点可以炫耀的成功都没有  像个傻瓜
I've got nothing to show for it, and I feel like a fool.

56
00:02:54,590 --> 00:02:56,100
好  我懂了
Okay. I get it.

57
00:02:56,460 --> 00:02:58,920
虽然中间的鬼话一个字没懂  但是...
I mean, not all the jibberjabber in the middle, but...

58
00:03:00,590 --> 00:03:01,340
我懂那种
I know what it's like

59
00:03:01,340 --> 00:03:02,700
全心全意都奉献给某个人事物
to put your heart and soul into something

60
