Oh, dear Lord.

349
00:16:45,050 --> 00:16:46,140
艾米呢
Where's Amy?

350
00:16:46,140 --> 00:16:48,330
她把你扶上床休息后就回家了
After she put you to bed, she went home.

351
00:16:50,050 --> 00:16:52,960
我应该打电话给她道歉
I should call her and apologize.

352
00:16:56,500 --> 00:16:58,510
-不好  -怎么了
- Oh, no. - What?

353
00:16:58,540 --> 00:17:01,780
看来我昨晚打了电话给史蒂芬·霍金
Apparently, I called Stephen Hawking last night.

354
00:17:02,690 --> 00:17:18,930
S·W·霍金教授

355
00:17:02,990 --> 00:17:04,890
第一条新留言
First new message.

356
00:17:04,890 --> 00:17:07,030
霍哥
Hawkman!

357
00:17:08,280 --> 00:17:11,350
我是你铁哥们儿谢肠镜啊
It's your old buddy Sheldonoscopy!

358
00:17:12,900 --> 00:17:15,280
你为什么不接电话呢
How come you didn't pick up the phone?!

359
00:17:15,280 --> 00:17:17,810
你的手动不了  我错了
Oh, right. My bad.

360
00:17:23,300 --> 00:17:25,170
你出奇的安静啊  还好吗
You're awful quiet. Everything okay?

361
00:17:26,270 --> 00:17:27,510
不太好
Not really.

362
00:17:27,740 --> 00:17:30,640
我昨晚丢人丢大了
I had a bit of an embarrassing evening.

363
00:17:30,640 --> 00:17:33,640
我也是  发生了什么事
Ugh. Me, too. What happened?

364
00:17:33,640 --> 00:17:35,440
我喝了酒
I drank alcohol

365
00:17:35,920 --> 00:17:40,130
给史蒂芬·霍金留了一通很不妙的留言
and may have left an unfortunate voice mail for Stephen Hawking.

366
00:17:41,510 --> 00:17:42,780
我觉得不用担心
I wouldn't worry about it.

367
00:17:42,780 --> 00:17:45,230
他这人幽默感挺强的
He's got a pretty good sense of humor.

368
00:17:45,760 --> 00:17:47,390
希望如此
Oh, I hope so.

369
00:17:47,980 --> 00:17:50,190
你昨晚发生了什么事
What happened to you last night?

370
00:17:50,360 --> 00:17:51,860
原来
Oh, well, turns out

371
00:17:51,860 --> 00:17:54,890
我以前见过拉杰的女友
I'd already met the girl Raj is seeing

372
00:17:54,890 --> 00:17:58,420
我当时在她家厕所留过号码
when I did a number on her bathroom.

373
00:18:01,490 --> 00:18:03,460
而那号码是"大号"
And that number was two.

374
00:18:06,530 --> 00:18:08,970
我一直很喜欢尼沙布尔的阿塔尔[诗人]
Well, you know, I've always been a fan

375
00:18:08,970 --> 00:18:11,840
写的一个故事
of a story told by Attar of Nishapur,

376
00:18:11,840 --> 00:18:13,270
说的是一个国王
about a king

377
00:18:13,400 --> 00:18:17,550
召集一群智者  制作一枚戒指
who assembled a group of wise men to create a ring

378
00:18:17,550 --> 00:18:19,870
让他在悲伤时能高兴起来
that would make him happy when he was sad.

379
00:18:19,870 --> 00:18:21,640
这枚戒指上
And that ring

380
00:18:21,640 --> 00:18:25,930
刻了一句话  "一切都会随风而逝"
was inscribed with the phrase, "This too shall pass."

381
00:18:27,110 --> 00:18:29,600
-库珀  -老天
- Hey, Cooper! - Oh, my God.

382
00:18:29,600 --> 00:18:32,990
我听说你昨晚给霍金打了醉酒电话
I heard you drunk-dialed Stephen Hawking last night?

383
00:18:33,880 --> 00:18:35,270
牛逼啊
Classic!

384
00:18:35,270 --> 00:18:36,800
快走开  巴里
Get out of here, Barry.

385
00:18:37,290 --> 00:18:38,540
你说了算
Whatever you say...

386
00:18:38,740 --> 00:18:40,410
卡屎拉
Clogzilla.

387
00:18:44,330 --> 00:18:46,640
卡屎拉  挺好笑的
Clogzilla. That's pretty funny.

388
00:18:48,300 --> 00:18:50,560
我不觉得有风能刮走"这坨屎"
I don't think that's gonna pass.

389
00:18:55,640 --> 00:18:57,080
下一条留言
Next message.

390
00:18:57,080 --> 00:18:58,650
又是我
It's me again!

391
00:18:58,920 --> 00:19:01,100
我放弃弦理论了
I gave up string theory.

392
00:19:01,310 --> 00:19:03,270
你也应该放弃黑洞
You should give up black holes,

393
00:19:03,270 --> 00:19:05,850
咱俩搭档绝对是罪案克星
and we can totally solve crimes together!

394
00:19:07,800 --> 00:19:09,190
下一条留言
Next message.

395
00:19:09,190 --> 00:19:11,260
你知道什么超棒吗
Do you know what's great?!

396
00:19:11,320 --> 00:19:14,220
地质学
Geology.

397
00:19:15,540 --> 00:19:17,810
看这个晶洞
Look at this geode!

398
00:19:17,830 --> 00:19:19,620
这个词读起来真有意思
That's fun to say!

399
00:19:19,660 --> 00:19:24,220
进  洞  井  洞
Gee... ode! Gee... ode!

400
00:19:24,490 --> 00:19:25,900
下一条留言
Next message.

401
00:19:25,900 --> 00:19:28,440
精  洞
Gee... ode!

402
00:19:28,440 --> 00:19:31,090
茎  洞
Gee... ode!

403
00:19:31,240 --> 00:19:33,230
小弟现在会和女生打啵啵了
I kiss girls now.

404
00:19:35,350 --> 00:19:36,510
下一条留言
Next message.

405
00:19:36,520 --> 00:19:38,230
猜猜我是谁
Hey, guess who I am!

406
00:19:38,240 --> 00:19:39,660
哔哔嘟嘟
Beep bop boop bop!

407
00:19:39,660 --> 00:19:41,610
我是你  懂了吗
I'm you! Get it?!

408
00:19:43,650 --> 00:19:45,110
下一条留言
Next message.

409
00:19:45,110 --> 00:19:46,400
你生我的气了吗
Are you mad at me?

410
00:19:48,020 --> 00:19:51,300
不好  你生人家的气了
Oh, no, you're mad at me.

411
00:19:51,300 --> 00:19:53,270
真是对不起
I'm so sorry!

412
00:19:54,040 --> 00:19:55,250
哔哔嘟嘟
Beep bop boop bop.

413
00:19:56,940 --> 00:19:58,240
下一条留言
Next message.

414
00:19:58,240 --> 00:20:03,550
硫硼尖晶石  牛棚鸡鸡石
Thiospinel sulfide. Thiospinel sulfide.

415
00:20:03,680 --> 00:20:06,750
这个念起来比"茎洞"更好玩
That's even more fun than "gee... ode."

416
00:20:08,130 --> 00:20:09,900
你看了《乐高大电影》吗
Hey, did you see The Lego Movie?

417
00:20:13,770 --> 00:20:16,090
傻逼
What a jackass.

